  "description": "The durable hard Tri-fold tonneau cover automatically latches into place when folded down, saving you the hassle of manual operation for enhanced security & convenience.\nFeatures\nas a front nylon strap. The backbox cover can be completely folded and fixed with Velcro, without disassembly.\nQuick clamp, easy to install. No need to drill or use special tools, you can easily clamp the guide rails and joints.\nPerfectly Fitment and free LED Light for visibility. This tonneau cover offers a precise and secure installation; Includes additional features, a Nylon Strap to secure, Embedded Clamps for fit, Bulletproof Wrench Clamp for safety, and complimentary LED Light for visibility.\nHeavy-duty crossbars. They support the surface by applying horizontal tension to provide maximum safety and durability.\n1-year Warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2024-2026 Toyota Tacoma (Excl. Trail Edition) with 5 Feet Bed with Tacoma Bed Rail.",
